{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UzVZbJ5krpzgcJxgjC1atU","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始framing完全成立。float32 confound修复后precision主效应坍缩至噪声水平，反而成为方法论贡献（展示engine配置对variance\n2\t  attribution的系统性影响）。 Item dominance在所有benchmark上复现为最大单一方差源，4个模型一致。Separability在aggregate\n3\t  level成立（direct interaction <0.5%）， 但item-conditional interactions提供nuanced story。D-study\n4\t  budget表给出clear actionable guidance，headline数字\"item selection >50%\"直接可用。 AAAI投稿节奏正常，三条claim原封不动。\n5\t\n6\t  '\n7\timagined_experiments:\n8\t- name: Full-scale precision study with confound fix\n9\t  plan_id: exp-001\n10\t  description: '4 models × 3 precisions (FP32/BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3\n11\t    temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items, 全部使用vLLM V0 enforce_eager消除engine差异。总条件数\n12\t    4×3×6×6×3×4=5184 per item, 总记录 5184×200=1,036,800。\n13\t\n14\t    '\n15\t  expected_results:\n16\t    total_records: 1036800\n17\t    conditions_per_model: 1296\n18\t    overall_accuracy: 0.668\n19\t    accuracy_fp32: 0.666\n20\t    accuracy_bf16: 0.671\n21\t    accuracy_fp16: 0.669\n22\t    accuracy_spread_across_precisions: 0.005\n23\t    item_id: 0.584\n24\t    residual: 0.168\n25\t    prompt_template_x_item_id: 0.061\n26\t    temperature_x_item_id: 0.058\n27\t    seed_x_item_id: 0.029\n28\t    precision_x_item_id: 0.018\n29\t    ordering_x_item_id: 0.014\n30\t    prompt_template: 0.009\n31\t    temperature: 0.007\n32\t    ordering: 0.003\n33\t    precision: 0.003\n34\t    seed: 0.001\n35\t    models_with_item_id_rank1: 4\n36\t    item_id_range_across_models:\n37\t    - 0.52\n38\t    - 0.62\n39\t    qwen3_8b_item_id: 0.598\n40\t    llama31_8b_item_id: 0.571\n41\t    gemma2_9b_item_id: 0.62\n42\t    mistral_7b_item_id: 0.547\n43\t    precision_main_effect_before_fix_mvp: 0.0087\n44\t    precision_main_effect_after_fix: 0.003\n45\t    precision_x_item_id_before_fix_mvp: 0.0724\n46\t    precision_x_item_id_after_fix: 0.018\n47\t    fp32_bf16_accuracy_gap_before_fix: 0.085\n48\t    fp32_bf16_accuracy_gap_after_fix: 0.005\n49\t    g_current_practice_1p1s200i: 0.34\n50\t    g_6p6s200i: 0.72\n51\t    g_6p6s200i_3t4o: 0.78\n52\t  result_rationale: 'MVP中precision主效应0.87%和precision×item交互7.24%主要来自float32使用不同vLLM\n53\t    engine路径（非V0时触发不同kernel）， 导致FP32准确率系统性偏低5.7pp。统一V0 enforce_eager后，三种精度走同一compute\n54\t    path， FP32/BF16/FP16准确率差收敛至0.5pp以内（纯numerical noise水平）。precision主效应从0.87%降至~0.3%，\n55\t    precision×item从7.24%降至~1.8%。这些被释放的方差份额主要回流到residual和item_id， 使item_id维持在~58%（与MVP一致，因为item\n56\t    difficulty本身是真实信号，不受engine confound影响）。 4个模型均以item_id为rank-1组分，因为MMLU的item difficulty分布（从trivial到expert-level）\n57\t    在所有7-9B模型上产生类似的accuracy ceiling/floor效应。Gemma-2略高因其instruction-tuned特性 使其对easy\n58\t    items更稳定（floor更高），Mistral略低因其在部分domain上accuracy更平坦。 200 items（分层采样）比MVP的50 items提供更稳定的方差估计，置信区间收窄约50%。\n59\t\n60\t    '\n61\t  tables:\n62\t  - name: 'Table 1: Variance Component Estimates — MMLU 200 items, 4 models pooled'\n63\t    columns:\n64\t    - Component\n65\t    - '% Variance'\n66\t    - SE\n67\t    - 95% CI Lower\n68\t    - 95% CI Upper\n69\t    - MVP (50 items)\n70\t    rows:\n71\t    - - item_id\n72\t      - 58.4\n73\t      - 2.1\n74\t      - 54.3\n75\t      - 62.5\n76\t      - 58.4\n77\t    - - residual\n78\t      - 16.8\n79\t      - 0.9\n80\t      - 15.0\n81\t      - 18.6\n82\t      - 17.6\n83\t    - - prompt×item\n84\t      - 6.1\n85\t      - 0.7\n86\t      - 4.7\n87\t      - 7.5\n88\t      - 5.7\n89\t    - - temp×item\n90\t      - 5.8\n91\t      - 0.6\n92\t      - 4.6\n93\t      - 7.0\n94\t      - 6.9\n95\t    - - seed×item\n96\t      - 2.9\n97\t      - 0.4\n98\t      - 2.1\n99\t      - 3.7\n100\t      - 2.7\n101\t    - - precision×item\n102\t      - 1.8\n103\t      - 0.3\n104\t      - 1.2\n105\t      - 2.4\n106\t      - 7.2*\n107\t    - - ordering×item\n108\t      - 1.4\n109\t      - 0.3\n110\t      - 0.8\n111\t      - 2.0\n112\t      - —\n113\t    - - prompt\n114\t      - 0.9\n115\t      - 0.3\n116\t      - 0.3\n117\t      - 1.5\n118\t      - —\n119\t    - - temperature\n120\t      - 0.7\n121\t      - 0.2\n122\t      - 0.3\n123\t      - 1.1\n124\t      - —\n125\t    - - precision\n126\t      - 0.3\n127\t      - 0.1\n128\t      - 0.1\n129\t      - 0.5\n130\t      - 0.87*\n131\t    - - ordering\n132\t      - 0.3\n133\t      - 0.1\n134\t      - 0.1\n135\t      - 0.5\n136\t      - —\n137\t    - - seed\n138\t      - 0.1\n139\t      - 0.05\n140\t      - 0.0\n141\t      - 0.2\n142\t      - —\n143\t  - name: 'Table 2: Per-Model item_id Variance Share'\n144\t    columns:\n145\t    - Model\n146\t    - item_id %\n147\t    - Next Largest\n148\t    - Next %\n149\t    rows:\n150\t    - - Qwen3-8B\n151\t      - 59.8\n152\t      - residual\n153\t      - 16.2\n154\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n155\t      - 57.1\n156\t      - residual\n157\t      - 17.8\n158\t    - - Gemma-2-9B-IT\n159\t      - 62.0\n160\t      - residual\n161\t      - 14.9\n162\t    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n163\t      - 54.7\n164\t      - residual\n165\t      - 18.5\n166\t  figures_description:\n167\t  - 'Fig 1: Stacked-bar variance decomposition — MVP (confounded) vs exp-001 (fixed),\n168\t    side-by-side。左栏显示precision和precision×item的膨胀，右栏显示修复后两者坍缩，item_id占比不变。'\n169\t  - 'Fig 2: 4-panel per-model stacked bars，展示item_id始终为rank-1的cross-model consistency。'\n170\t  - 'Fig 3: FP32 vs BF16 accuracy scatter (per-item)，MVP中slope偏离1.0，exp-001中回归到~1.0。'\n171\t  analysis: '核心发现：engine confound修复后item dominance完全稳健，precision主效应从0.87%降至0.3%。 这同时验证了Claim\n172\t    1（item dominance）和提供了方法论贡献（engine配置对variance attribution的影响）。 4个模型一致性消除了\"Qwen3特例\"的concern。200\n173\t    items分层采样提供了足够的statistical power。 Ordering facet新增后占比很小（~1.7% total含interaction），说明item\n174\t    presentation order不是主要concern。\n175\t\n176\t    '\n177\t- name: Multi-benchmark replication\n178\t  plan_id: exp-002\n179\t  description: '4 models × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures\n180\t    × 4 orderings × 200 items, 分别在GSM8K、ARC-Challenge、HellaSwag上运行。每benchmark总记录 4×2×6×6×2×4×200=230,400。\n181\t\n182\t    '\n183\t  expected_results:\n184\t    gsm8k_overall_accuracy: 0.583\n185\t    gsm8k_item_id: 0.487\n186\t    gsm8k_residual: 0.214\n187\t    gsm8k_temperature_x_item_id: 0.089\n188\t    gsm8k_prompt_x_item_id: 0.072\n189\t    gsm8k_seed_x_item_id: 0.041\n190\t    gsm8k_precision_x_item_id: 0.012\n191\t    gsm8k_ordering_x_item_id: 0.018\n192\t    gsm8k_temperature: 0.024\n193\t    gsm8k_prompt: 0.015\n194\t    gsm8k_precision: 0.002\n195\t    gsm8k_g_current_practice: 0.29\n196\t    arc_overall_accuracy: 0.597\n197\t    arc_item_id: 0.551\n198\t    arc_residual: 0.182\n199\t    arc_prompt_x_item_id: 0.068\n200\t    arc_temperature_x_item_id: 0.054\n201\t    arc_seed_x_item_id: 0.031\n202\t    arc_precision_x_item_id: 0.014\n203\t    arc_ordering_x_item_id: 0.016\n204\t    arc_prompt: 0.011\n205\t    arc_temperature: 0.008\n206\t    arc_precision: 0.002\n207\t    arc_g_current_practice: 0.32\n208\t    hellaswag_overall_accuracy: 0.712\n209\t    hellaswag_item_id: 0.527\n210\t    hellaswag_residual: 0.195\n211\t    hellaswag_prompt_x_item_id: 0.058\n212\t    hellaswag_temperature_x_item_id: 0.062\n213\t    hellaswag_seed_x_item_id: 0.033\n214\t    hellaswag_precision_x_item_id: 0.011\n215\t    hellaswag_ordering_x_item_id: 0.019\n216\t    hellaswag_prompt: 0.008\n217\t    hellaswag_temperature: 0.006\n218\t    hellaswag_precision: 0.001\n219\t    hellaswag_g_current_practice: 0.36\n220\t    benchmarks_with_item_id_rank1: 4\n221\t    item_id_range_across_benchmarks:\n222\t    - 0.487\n223\t    - 0.584\n224\t    cross_benchmark_replication_rate: 1.0\n225\t    models_showing_consistent_pattern: 4\n226\t  result_rationale: 'GSM8K的item_id占比略低于MMLU（48.7% vs 58.4%），因为数学推理任务引入更多chain-of-thought随机性，\n227\t    使residual和temperature×item交互膨胀。GSM8K中温度效应更大（temperature×item 8.9%）， 因为CoT生成路径对sampling\n228\t    temperature更敏感——同一道数学题在不同温度下可能走完全不同的推理链。 但item_id仍然是rank-1组分，因为GSM8K的difficulty\n229\t    gradient极陡（从单步算术到多步word problem）， 这种item-level variance在所有条件下都主导。ARC-Challenge的item_id（55.1%）接近MMLU，\n230\t    因为科学推理题的difficulty分布类似（从factual recall到multi-hop inference）。 HellaSwag的item_id（52.7%）也稳健，因为commonsense\n231\t    completion的item variance主要来自 distractor quality差异——有些items的wrong answers显而易见，有些几乎无法区分。\n232\t    所有benchmark上precision主效应均<0.3%，确认engine confound fix的泛化性。 4/4 benchmark的item_id\n233\t    rank-1复现率为100%，支撑\"cross-benchmark replication rate = 1.0\"。\n234\t\n235\t    '\n236\t  tables:\n237\t  - name: 'Table 3: Cross-Benchmark Variance Decomposition Summary'\n238\t    columns:\n239\t    - Benchmark\n240\t    - item_id %\n241\t    - Residual %\n242\t    - Item-Conditional Total %\n243\t    - Precision Main %\n244\t    - G (current)\n245\t    rows:\n246\t    - - MMLU\n247\t      - 58.4\n248\t      - 16.8\n249\t      - 16.1\n250\t      - 0.3\n251\t      - 0.34\n252\t    - - GSM8K\n253\t      - 48.7\n254\t      - 21.4\n255\t      - 23.2\n256\t      - 0.2\n257\t      - 0.29\n258\t    - - ARC-Challenge\n259\t      - 55.1\n260\t      - 18.2\n261\t      - 18.3\n262\t      - 0.2\n263\t      - 0.32\n264\t    - - HellaSwag\n265\t      - 52.7\n266\t      - 19.5\n267\t      - 18.3\n268\t      - 0.1\n269\t      - 0.36\n270\t  - name: 'Table 4: GSM8K Per-Model Breakdown'\n271\t    columns:\n272\t    - Model\n273\t    - item_id %\n274\t    - temp×item %\n275\t    - prompt×item %\n276\t    - residual %\n277\t    rows:\n278\t    - - Qwen3-8B\n279\t      - 51.2\n280\t      - 8.1\n281\t      - 6.8\n282\t      - 19.8\n283\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n284\t      - 47.3\n285\t      - 9.4\n286\t      - 7.6\n287\t      - 22.1\n288\t    - - Gemma-2-9B-IT\n289\t      - 50.8\n290\t      - 8.5\n291\t      - 6.9\n292\t      - 20.3\n293\t    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n294\t      - 43.4\n295\t      - 10.5\n296\t      - 8.3\n297\t      - 23.5\n298\t  figures_description:\n299\t  - 'Fig 4: 4-benchmark stacked-bar variance decomposition并排对比。item_id始终为最大色块，但GSM8K的residual和temperature×item色块明显更大。'\n300\t  - 'Fig 5: Heatmap — benchmark × model × component，展示pattern consistency。色块深浅表示variance\n301\t    share，item_id行始终最深。'\n302\t  analysis: 'Item dominance在4个benchmark上全部复现（range 48.7%-58.4%），但幅度因task type有系统性差异：\n303\t    generation-heavy tasks（GSM8K）因CoT随机性使residual膨胀，压缩item_id相对占比； classification-like\n304\t    tasks（MMLU, ARC）的item_id更高。这个gradient本身是有趣的发现， 可在Discussion中展开。关键是即使在\"worst case\"的GSM8K上，item_id仍是rank-1（48.7%\n305\t    > residual 21.4%）， headline claim成立。\n306\t\n307\t    '\n308\t- name: Multi-hardware G-study\n309\t  plan_id: exp-003\n310\t  description: '4 models × 2 GPU types (RTX PRO 6000 + second GPU) × 2 precisions\n311\t    (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。总记录\n312\t    4×2×2×6×6×3×4×200=691,200。 核心目标：量化hardware主效应和hardware×methodology交互。\n313\t\n314\t    '\n315\t  expected_results:\n316\t    total_records: 691200\n317\t    hardware_main_effect: 0.006\n318\t    hardware_x_precision: 0.002\n319\t    hardware_x_prompt: 0.001\n320\t    hardware_x_temperature: 0.001\n321\t    hardware_x_seed: 0.0005\n322\t    hardware_x_ordering: 0.0003\n323\t    hardware_x_item_id: 0.019\n324\t    precision_x_prompt: 0.0008\n325\t    precision_x_temperature: 0.0006\n326\t    precision_x_seed: 0.0003\n327\t    precision_x_ordering: 0.0002\n328\t    direct_infra_method_interaction_total: 0.005\n329\t    item_conditional_interactions_total: 0.142\n330\t    item_id: 0.561\n331\t    residual: 0.152\n332\t    prompt_x_item: 0.059\n333\t    temperature_x_item: 0.055\n334\t    seed_x_item: 0.028\n335\t    precision_x_item: 0.017\n336\t    ordering_x_item: 0.013\n337\t    hardware_x_item: 0.019\n338\t    separability_ratio: 0.035\n339\t    gpu1_gpu2_accuracy_correlation: 0.9987\n340\t    max_accuracy_difference_any_condition: 0.018\n341\t    mean_accuracy_difference: 0.004\n342\t    g_current_practice: 0.33\n343\t    g_full_design: 0.81\n344\t  result_rationale: 'Hardware主效应0.6%反映两块GPU的微架构差异（不同SM count、memory bandwidth、kernel\n345\t    scheduling）， 但这些差异是系统性的（固定偏移），不是随机的，所以主效应很小。hardware×item交互1.9%比hardware主效应大，\n346\t    因为特定items（如需要长sequence generation的items）在不同GPU上因kernel tiling差异产生不同的numerical\n347\t    path， 但这只影响边界case items。所有direct infra×method交互加总仅0.5%，因为infrastructure层（hardware\n348\t    type, precision） 和methodology层（prompt, seed, temperature, ordering）作用于不同的computation\n349\t    stages： precision/hardware影响numerical computation，prompt/seed/temperature影响token\n350\t    sampling， 两者的交叉点（sampling受precision影响的程度）在logit空间中被softmax压缩到negligible水平。 Item-conditional\n351\t    interactions总和14.2%远大于direct interactions 0.5%，验证了Claim 2的nuanced story： separability在aggregate成立，但两层都通过item\n352\t    difficulty调节其效应。 GPU间accuracy correlation 0.9987说明hardware几乎不改变model ranking，只在individual\n353\t    item level引入微小噪声。\n354\t\n355\t    '\n356\t  tables:\n357\t  - name: 'Table 5: Separability Test — Direct vs Item-Conditional Interactions'\n358\t    columns:\n359\t    - Interaction Type\n360\t    - Components\n361\t    - Total % Variance\n362\t    - Interpretation\n363\t    rows:\n364\t    - - Direct Infra×Method\n365\t      - hw×prompt, hw×temp, hw×seed, hw×ord, prec×prompt, prec×temp, prec×seed, prec×ord\n366\t      - 0.5\n367\t      - Negligible — separability holds at aggregate\n368\t    - - Infra×Item\n369\t      - hw×item, prec×item\n370\t      - 3.6\n371\t      - Small but non-zero — hardware/precision effects are item-conditional\n372\t    - - Method×Item\n373\t      - prompt×item, temp×item, seed×item, ord×item\n374\t      - 15.5\n375\t      - Substantial — methodology effects are strongly item-conditional\n376\t    - - Item Main\n377\t      - item_id\n378\t      - 56.1\n379\t      - Dominant — item selection is the primary variance source\n380\t  - name: 'Table 6: Hardware Agreement Matrix (per-model mean accuracy)'\n381\t    columns:\n382\t    - Model\n383\t    - GPU1\n384\t    - GPU2\n385\t    - Difference\n386\t    rows:\n387\t    - - Qwen3-8B\n388\t      - 0.671\n389\t      - 0.668\n390\t      - 0.003\n391\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n392\t      - 0.654\n393\t      - 0.65\n394\t      - 0.004\n395\t    - - Gemma-2-9B-IT\n396\t      - 0.689\n397\t      - 0.684\n398\t      - 0.005\n399\t    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n400\t      - 0.638\n401\t      - 0.634\n402\t      - 0.004\n403\t  figures_description:\n404\t  - 'Fig 6: Separability diagram — 两层圆（infra layer, method layer）通过item difficulty连接，直接交互箭头用虚线（<0.5%），item-conditional箭头用实线。'\n405\t  - 'Fig 7: GPU1 vs GPU2 per-item accuracy scatter，近乎perfect diagonal，少数outlier items标注。'\n406\t  analysis: 'Separability成立：direct infra×method交互总和0.5%，远低于1%阈值。但不是trivial null result——\n407\t    item-conditional interactions（14.2%）提供了nuanced interpretation：infrastructure和methodology\n408\t    不是完全独立的，而是通过item difficulty间接耦合。这比simple \"separable/not separable\"更有价值， 因为它解释了为什么isolated-factor\n409\t    studies的结论在某些items上不泛化。 这同时支撑了Claim 2的两半：\"empirical license for isolated-factor\n410\t    studies\"（direct <0.5%） 和 \"conclusions are conditional on item selection\"（item-conditional\n411\t    14.2%）。\n412\t\n413\t    '\n414\t- name: D-study reproducibility budget projections\n415\t  plan_id: exp-004\n416\t  description: '基于exp-001/002/003的合并variance component estimates，计算不同facet allocation下的G系数。\n417\t    生成practitioner-facing budget tables和projection curves。纯计算，无GPU开销。\n418\t\n419\t    '\n420\t  expected_results:\n421\t    g_1prompt_1seed_200items_mmlu: 0.34\n422\t    g_1prompt_1seed_200items_gsm8k: 0.29\n423\t    g_1prompt_1seed_200items_arc: 0.32\n424\t    g_1prompt_1seed_200items_hellaswag: 0.36\n425\t    g_1prompt_1seed_600items_mmlu: 0.71\n426\t    g_1prompt_1seed_1000items_mmlu: 0.82\n427\t    g_1prompt_1seed_2000items_mmlu: 0.9\n428\t    g_3prompt_1seed_200items_mmlu: 0.42\n429\t    g_6prompt_1seed_200items_mmlu: 0.49\n430\t    g_12prompt_1seed_200items_mmlu: 0.54\n431\t    g_1prompt_3seed_200items_mmlu: 0.36\n432\t    g_1prompt_6seed_200items_mmlu: 0.37\n433\t    optimal_g90_items: 600\n434\t    optimal_g90_prompts: 3\n435\t    optimal_g90_seeds: 2\n436\t    optimal_g90_total_conditions: 6\n437\t    optimal_g90_total_evaluations: 3600\n438\t    optimal_g95_items: 1200\n439\t    optimal_g95_prompts: 4\n440\t    optimal_g95_seeds: 3\n441\t    optimal_g95_total_conditions: 12\n442\t    optimal_g95_total_evaluations: 14400\n443\t    marginal_g_per_100_items: 0.038\n444\t    marginal_g_per_prompt: 0.025\n445\t    marginal_g_per_seed: 0.005\n446\t    items_vs_prompts_effectiveness_ratio: 10.2\n447\t    items_vs_seeds_effectiveness_ratio: 51.0\n448\t    gsm8k_optimal_g90_items: 800\n449\t    gsm8k_optimal_g90_prompts: 3\n450\t    gsm8k_optimal_g90_seeds: 2\n451\t    arc_optimal_g90_items: 650\n452\t    hellaswag_optimal_g90_items: 550\n453\t  result_rationale: 'G系数由universe score variance与observed score variance的比值决定。因为item_id占总方差>50%，\n454\t    增加item采样直接压缩最大的variance component，G提升最快。具体地，G ≈ σ²(τ) / [σ²(τ) + σ²(δ)/n_facets]，\n455\t    当item_id是σ²(δ)的主要贡献者时，增加n_items的marginal return远超增加n_prompts或n_seeds。 数值上，从200到600\n456\t    items（3×）使G从0.34升至0.71，而从1到3 prompts（3×）仅从0.34升至0.42。 这是因为prompt variance（含prompt×item）共计~7%，而item\n457\t    variance 58%。 Seed几乎无效（G从0.34到0.37 at 6 seeds），因为seed的总方差贡献<3%（主要通过seed×item）。\n458\t    G≥0.90需要~600 items + 3 prompts + 2 seeds = 3,600 evaluations。 当前标准practice（1 prompt,\n459\t    1 seed, 200 items）的G < 0.40意味着evaluation结果的reliability 低于社会科学中\"不可接受\"的阈值（通常G≥0.80）。\n460\t    GSM8K需要更多items（800 vs 600）达到G≥0.90，因为其residual更大（CoT随机性）， 需要更多items来平均掉item-level\n461\t    noise。\n462\t\n463\t    '\n464\t  tables:\n465\t  - name: 'Table 7: Reproducibility Budget — MMLU (Items × Prompts × Seeds → G coefficient)'\n466\t    columns:\n467\t    - Items\n468\t    - Prompts\n469\t    - Seeds\n470\t    - Total Evals\n471\t    - G coeff\n472\t    - Δ vs Current\n473\t    rows:\n474\t    - - 200\n475\t      - 1\n476\t      - 1\n477\t      - 200\n478\t      - 0.34\n479\t      - baseline\n480\t    - - 200\n481\t      - 3\n482\t      - 1\n483\t      - 600\n484\t      - 0.42\n485\t      - '+0.08'\n486\t    - - 200\n487\t      - 6\n488\t      - 1\n489\t      - 1200\n490\t      - 0.49\n491\t      - '+0.15'\n492\t    - - 200\n493\t      - 6\n494\t      - 6\n495\t      - 7200\n496\t      - 0.54\n497\t      - '+0.20'\n498\t    - - 600\n499\t      - 1\n500\t      - 1\n501\t      - 600\n502\t      - 0.71\n503\t      - '+0.37'\n504\t    - - 600\n505\t      - 3\n506\t      - 1\n507\t      - 1800\n508\t      - 0.82\n509\t      - '+0.48'\n510\t    - - 600\n511\t      - 3\n512\t      - 2\n513\t      - 3600\n514\t      - 0.9\n515\t      - '+0.56'\n516\t    - - 1000\n517\t      - 3\n518\t      - 2\n519\t      - 6000\n520\t      - 0.93\n521\t      - '+0.59'\n522\t    - - 1200\n523\t      - 4\n524\t      - 3\n525\t      - 14400\n526\t      - 0.95\n527\t      - '+0.61'\n528\t    - - 2000\n529\t      - 4\n530\t      - 3\n531\t      - 24000\n532\t      - 0.97\n533\t      - '+0.63'\n534\t  - name: 'Table 8: Cross-Benchmark Minimum Budget for G≥0.90'\n535\t    columns:\n536\t    - Benchmark\n537\t    - Items\n538\t    - Prompts\n539\t    - Seeds\n540\t    - Total Evals\n541\t    - Cost Factor vs Current\n542\t    rows:\n543\t    - - MMLU\n544\t      - 600\n545\t      - 3\n546\t      - 2\n547\t      - 3600\n548\t      - 18×\n549\t    - - GSM8K\n550\t      - 800\n551\t      - 3\n552\t      - 2\n553\t      - 4800\n554\t      - 24×\n555\t    - - ARC-Challenge\n556\t      - 650\n557\t      - 3\n558\t      - 2\n559\t      - 3900\n560\t      - 19.5×\n561\t    - - HellaSwag\n562\t      - 550\n563\t      - 3\n564\t      - 2\n565\t      - 3300\n566\t      - 16.5×\n567\t  figures_description:\n568\t  - 'Fig 8: D-study projection curves — G coefficient vs total evaluations，三条线分别对应\n569\t    scale items only / scale prompts only / scale seeds only。Items线陡峭上升，prompts线平缓，seeds线几乎flat。'\n570\t  - 'Fig 9: Iso-G contour plot（items × prompts平面，G值等高线），展示最优allocation路径沿items轴延伸。'\n571\t  - 'Fig 10: 4-benchmark overlay projection curves，展示GSM8K需要更多evaluations但pattern一致。'\n572\t  analysis: 'Claim 3的核心表格。Headline数字：\"tripling items is 10× more effective than tripling\n573\t    prompts\" 直接来自marginal effectiveness ratio 10.2:1。当前practice G<0.40的发现具有强policy\n574\t    implication—— 意味着现有leaderboard结果的measurement reliability低于社会科学中最低标准。 600 items\n575\t    + 3 prompts + 2 seeds的\"recommended minimum\"在计算成本上仅为full factorial的一小部分， 是actionable的建议。跨benchmark\n576\t    budget差异（550-800 items for G≥0.90）提供task-specific guidance。\n577\t\n578\t    '\n579\t- name: 14B model extension\n580\t  plan_id: exp-005\n581\t  description: 'Qwen3-14B和DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts\n582\t    × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。每模型 2×6×6×3×4×200=172,800记录。\n583\t\n584\t    '\n585\t  expected_results:\n586\t    qwen3_14b_accuracy: 0.728\n587\t    deepseek_r1_14b_accuracy: 0.714\n588\t    qwen3_14b_item_id: 0.574\n589\t    deepseek_r1_14b_item_id: 0.538\n590\t    qwen3_14b_residual: 0.162\n591\t    deepseek_r1_14b_residual: 0.198\n592\t    deepseek_r1_14b_temperature_x_item: 0.082\n593\t    scale_effect_on_item_id: within 8B model range\n594\t    item_id_rank1_both_models: true\n595\t    variance_pattern_consistent_with_8b: true\n596\t    precision_main_effect_14b: 0.002\n597\t  result_rationale: '14B模型的overall accuracy更高，但item difficulty的variance structure不会因scale改变——\n598\t    easy items仍然easy，hard items仍然hard。Item_id占比略低于8B平均值（~55-57% vs ~58%）， 因为14B模型在medium-difficulty\n599\t    items上表现更一致（ceiling effect压缩了item variance的上端）， 但差异不大。DeepSeek-R1-Distill的reasoning-distilled特性使其在CoT-heavy\n600\t    items上产生更多 temperature×item交互（类似GSM8K的pattern），residual也略高，因为distillation引入的implicit\n601\t    CoT 增加了generation-level stochasticity。关键是item_id在两个14B模型上仍为rank-1， 确认pattern不随model\n602\t    scale改变。precision主效应在14B上同样negligible（0.2%）， 因为confound fix的原理（统一engine path）与model\n603\t    size无关。\n604\t\n605\t    '\n606\t  tables:\n607\t  - name: 'Table 9: 14B vs 8B Variance Pattern Comparison'\n608\t    columns:\n609\t    - Component\n610\t    - 8B Mean\n611\t    - 8B Range\n612\t    - Qwen3-14B\n613\t    - DS-R1-14B\n614\t    rows:\n615\t    - - item_id\n616\t      - 58.4\n617\t      - 54.7–62.0\n618\t      - 57.4\n619\t      - 53.8\n620\t    - - residual\n621\t      - 16.8\n622\t      - 14.9–18.5\n623\t      - 16.2\n624\t      - 19.8\n625\t    - - temp×item\n626\t      - 5.8\n627\t      - 4.6–7.0\n628\t      - 5.3\n629\t      - 8.2\n630\t    - - prompt×item\n631\t      - 6.1\n632\t      - 4.7–7.5\n633\t      - 5.8\n634\t      - 5.4\n635\t    - - precision\n636\t      - 0.3\n637\t      - 0.1–0.5\n638\t      - 0.2\n639\t      - 0.2\n640\t  figures_description:\n641\t  - 'Fig 11: 6-model panel（4×8B + 2×14B）stacked bars，展示scale不改变variance hierarchy。'\n642\t  analysis: 'Scale invariance确认：item dominance不是小模型artifacts。DeepSeek-R1-Distill的slightly不同的profile\n643\t    （更高residual, 更高temp×item）提供了architecture effect的初步evidence， 但不改变core claim。这是P1实验，为paper增加robustness但非必需。\n644\t\n645\t    '\n646\t- name: Fine-tuning G-study\n647\t  plan_id: exp-006\n648\t  description: 'RoBERTa-large在SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA上fine-tuning。6 seeds × 3 learning\n649\t    rates × 4 data shuffles × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task × 4 tasks = 1,728\n650\t    total。\n651\t\n652\t    '\n653\t  expected_results:\n654\t    sst2_accuracy_mean: 0.948\n655\t    sst2_item_id: 0.412\n656\t    sst2_seed: 0.087\n657\t    sst2_learning_rate: 0.063\n658\t    sst2_data_shuffle: 0.042\n659\t    sst2_seed_x_item: 0.098\n660\t    sst2_lr_x_item: 0.074\n661\t    sst2_residual: 0.131\n662\t    sst2_gpu: 0.003\n663\t    sst2_precision: 0.002\n664\t    mnli_accuracy_mean: 0.876\n665\t    mnli_item_id: 0.445\n666\t    mnli_seed: 0.072\n667\t    mnli_learning_rate: 0.081\n668\t    mnli_data_shuffle: 0.038\n669\t    mnli_seed_x_item: 0.091\n670\t    mnli_residual: 0.142\n671\t    rte_accuracy_mean: 0.743\n672\t    rte_item_id: 0.368\n673\t    rte_seed: 0.124\n674\t    rte_learning_rate: 0.098\n675\t    rte_data_shuffle: 0.067\n676\t    rte_seed_x_item: 0.112\n677\t    rte_residual: 0.158\n678\t    copa_accuracy_mean: 0.682\n679\t    copa_item_id: 0.382\n680\t    copa_seed: 0.118\n681\t    copa_learning_rate: 0.091\n682\t    copa_residual: 0.167\n683\t    item_id_rank1_all_tasks: true\n684\t    seed_more_important_than_inference: true\n685\t    infra_effects_negligible: true\n686\t    fine_tuning_g_current_practice: 0.28\n687\t  result_rationale: 'Fine-tuning与inference的关键区别：training seed和learning rate成为substantial\n688\t    variance sources （combined 10-22%），因为它们影响optimization trajectory，不仅仅是sampling\n689\t    randomness。 但item_id仍然是rank-1（37-45%），因为NLU tasks的item difficulty gradient—— 从\"I\n690\t    love this movie\"(trivially positive)到需要subtle pragmatic inference的examples—— 在所有training\n691\t    configurations下都产生consistent accuracy variation。 RTE的item_id最低（36.8%），因为小数据集（2.5K\n692\t    training examples）使fine-tuning对seed更敏感， seed主效应膨胀到12.4%。这为paper提供了\"inference vs\n693\t    fine-tuning\"的对比dimension： 两者都是item-dominant，但fine-tuning中training hyperparameters（seed,\n694\t    LR）取代了 inference中的generation parameters（temperature, prompt）成为第二梯队的variance sources。\n695\t    GPU和precision主效应在fine-tuning中同样negligible（<0.5%），因为RoBERTa-large 对numerical precision不敏感（unlike\n696\t    large generative models的autoregressive error accumulation）。\n697\t\n698\t    '\n699\t  tables:\n700\t  - name: 'Table 10: Fine-tuning vs Inference Variance Hierarchy'\n701\t    columns:\n702\t    - Rank\n703\t    - Inference (MMLU)\n704\t    - Fine-tuning (SST-2)\n705\t    rows:\n706\t    - - 1\n707\t      - item_id (58.4%)\n708\t      - item_id (41.2%)\n709\t    - - 2\n710\t      - residual (16.8%)\n711\t      - residual (13.1%)\n712\t    - - 3\n713\t      - prompt×item (6.1%)\n714\t      - seed×item (9.8%)\n715\t    - - 4\n716\t      - temp×item (5.8%)\n717\t      - seed (8.7%)\n718\t    - - 5\n719\t      - seed×item (2.9%)\n720\t      - lr×item (7.4%)\n721\t    - - 6\n722\t      - precision×item (1.8%)\n723\t      - lr (6.3%)\n724\t  figures_description:\n725\t  - 'Fig 12: Inference vs Fine-tuning stacked bars并排，展示item_id在两个paradigm中均为rank-1但fine-tuning中seed/LR更prominent。'\n726\t  - 'Fig 13: 4-task fine-tuning panel，展示dataset size对variance structure的调节效应（RTE seed最大）。'\n727\t  analysis: 'Fine-tuning G-study将paper从\"inference evaluation reproducibility\"扩展到\"ML\n728\t    reproducibility broadly\"。 核心takeaway：item dominance是跨paradigm的（inference和fine-tuning），但second-tier\n729\t    factors不同。 这是P1实验，为paper增加generality但AAAI投稿时可作为supplementary。\n730\t\n731\t    '\n732\t- name: LayerCast precision study\n733\t  plan_id: exp-007\n734\t  description: '在MMLU上测试LayerCast（FP16 storage + FP32 compute）作为额外precision condition。\n735\t    4 models × 1 precision mode × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings\n736\t    × 200 items = 172,800记录。\n737\t\n738\t    '\n739\t  expected_results:\n740\t    layercast_accuracy_mean: 0.67\n741\t    layercast_vs_fp32_accuracy_diff: 0.004\n742\t    layercast_vs_bf16_accuracy_diff: -0.001\n743\t    layercast_item_agreement_with_fp32: 0.9991\n744\t    layercast_item_agreement_with_bf16: 0.9994\n745\t    layercast_added_variance_to_precision: 0.0004\n746\t    layercast_throughput_vs_fp32: 1.38\n747\t    layercast_throughput_vs_bf16: 0.91\n748\t    layercast_precision_x_item_contribution: 0.009\n749\t  result_rationale: 'LayerCast在存储时用FP16减少memory footprint，在compute时cast to FP32， 因此其numerical\n750\t    behavior几乎等同于纯FP32（computation path一致）， accuracy差异仅来自storage时的precision loss（FP16\n751\t    mantissa 10 bits vs FP32 23 bits）， 这对大部分weights来说negligible（在训练时weights就是从FP16/BF16来的）。\n752\t    与BF16的差异更小（0.1pp），因为BF16的dynamic range与FP32一致（8-bit exponent）， 而FP16的range更窄但mantissa更宽，两者accuracy接近。\n753\t    LayerCast对precision variance几乎没有增量贡献（0.04%），因为它本质上是FP32 compute的cheaper variant。\n754\t    Throughput方面，LayerCast比FP32快38%（memory bandwidth节省），比BF16慢9%（需要cast操作）。 这个实验为paper提供了一个\"practical\n755\t    mitigation\"故事：如果practitioner担心precision影响， LayerCast以minimal overhead提供FP32-level\n756\t    behavior。\n757\t\n758\t    '\n759\t  tables:\n760\t  - name: 'Table 11: Precision Mode Comparison'\n761\t    columns:\n762\t    - Mode\n763\t    - Accuracy\n764\t    - item Agreement w/ FP32\n765\t    - Throughput (tokens/s)\n766\t    - VRAM (GB)\n767\t    rows:\n768\t    - - FP32\n769\t      - 0.666\n770\t      - 1.0\n771\t      - 1820\n772\t      - 31.2\n773\t    - - BF16\n774\t      - 0.671\n775\t      - 0.9985\n776\t      - 2760\n777\t      - 15.8\n778\t    - - FP16\n779\t      - 0.669\n780\t      - 0.9982\n781\t      - 2810\n782\t      - 15.6\n783\t    - - LayerCast\n784\t      - 0.67\n785\t      - 0.9991\n786\t      - 2510\n787\t      - 16.1\n788\t  figures_description:\n789\t  - 'Fig 14: 4-precision mode accuracy distribution violin plots，展示LayerCast与FP32几乎identical\n790\t    spread。'\n791\t  analysis: 'P2实验。LayerCast结果进一步support precision不是major concern（在engine confound\n792\t    fix后）。 可作为paper中\"practical recommendation\"段落的一条：对于追求最高reproducibility的场景， LayerCast提供了memory-efficient的FP32-equivalent选项。\n793\t\n794\t    '\n795\t- name: MATH benchmark extension\n796\t  plan_id: exp-008\n797\t  description: '4 models × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures\n798\t    × 4 orderings × 200 MATH items。 总记录 4×2×6×6×2×4×200=230,400。测试reasoning-heavy\n799\t    task的variance structure。\n800\t\n801\t    '\n802\t  expected_results:\n803\t    math_overall_accuracy: 0.342\n804\t    math_item_id: 0.421\n805\t    math_residual: 0.248\n806\t    math_temperature_x_item: 0.104\n807\t    math_prompt_x_item: 0.068\n808\t    math_seed_x_item: 0.052\n809\t    math_temperature: 0.038\n810\t    math_prompt: 0.021\n811\t    math_precision: 0.002\n812\t    math_precision_x_item: 0.008\n813\t    math_ordering_x_item: 0.015\n814\t    math_g_current_practice: 0.24\n815\t    math_item_id_rank1: true\n816\t    math_optimal_g90_items: 1100\n817\t    math_optimal_g90_prompts: 4\n818\t    math_optimal_g90_seeds: 3\n819\t  result_rationale: 'MATH是所有benchmark中最challenging的（accuracy ~34%），其item difficulty分布极端——\n820\t    从Level 1（algebra basics）到Level 5（competition math），跨越巨大的difficulty range。 Item_id仍为rank-1（42.1%）但低于MMLU，因为：(1)\n821\t    lower overall accuracy增加了random guessing的比例， 膨胀residual到24.8%；(2) MATH的CoT generation比GSM8K更长更复杂（多步proof-like\n822\t    reasoning）， 使temperature×item interaction达到10.4%——在高temperature下，长推理链的任何一步都可能diverge，\n823\t    且这种sensitivity是item-specific的（Level 5 problems的长推理链比Level 1的短计算更sensitive）。 Temperature主效应也最高（3.8%），因为MATH的generation\n824\t    length使sampling temperature的cumulative effect更显著。 G current practice仅0.24——所有benchmark中最低——意味着MATH\n825\t    evaluation的reproducibility最差。 达到G≥0.90需要1100 items + 4 prompts + 3 seeds，是MMLU所需的~3倍evaluation\n826\t    budget。 这个发现有strong policy implication：reasoning benchmark的evaluation标准需要比classification\n827\t    benchmark更严格。\n828\t\n829\t    '\n830\t  tables:\n831\t  - name: 'Table 12: Full Cross-Benchmark Variance Summary (5 benchmarks)'\n832\t    columns:\n833\t    - Benchmark\n834\t    - Accuracy\n835\t    - item_id %\n836\t    - Residual %\n837\t    - Temp×Item %\n838\t    - G (current)\n839\t    - Items for G≥0.90\n840\t    rows:\n841\t    - - MMLU\n842\t      - 0.668\n843\t      - 58.4\n844\t      - 16.8\n845\t      - 5.8\n846\t      - 0.34\n847\t      - 600\n848\t    - - ARC-Challenge\n849\t      - 0.597\n850\t      - 55.1\n851\t      - 18.2\n852\t      - 5.4\n853\t      - 0.32\n854\t      - 650\n855\t    - - HellaSwag\n856\t      - 0.712\n857\t      - 52.7\n858\t      - 19.5\n859\t      - 6.2\n860\t      - 0.36\n861\t      - 550\n862\t    - - GSM8K\n863\t      - 0.583\n864\t      - 48.7\n865\t      - 21.4\n866\t      - 8.9\n867\t      - 0.29\n868\t      - 800\n869\t    - - MATH\n870\t      - 0.342\n871\t      - 42.1\n872\t      - 24.8\n873\t      - 10.4\n874\t      - 0.24\n875\t      - 1100\n876\t  figures_description:\n877\t  - 'Fig 15: 5-benchmark stacked bars排序by task difficulty，展示清晰的gradient：task越难→item_id越低、residual和temp×item越高。'\n878\t  - 'Fig 16: D-study projection curves for 5 benchmarks overlay，MATH曲线最右（需最多evaluations达G≥0.90）。'\n879\t  analysis: MATH提供了variance structure的\"stress test\"。Item_id在最extreme条件下仍为rank-1（42.1%），\n880\t    但task difficulty明显调节了variance decomposition的profile。5个benchmark展现了清晰的gradient：\n881\t    task difficulty ↑ → item_id share ↓, residual ↑, temperature×item ↑, G current\n882\t    practice ↓。 这个gradient本身是publishable finding：它量化了为什么reasoning benchmark的evaluation更不稳定，\n883\t    并给出了task-specific的reproducibility budget。\n884\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cd38c1e3-03ce-42e8-b8f6-251f05ecd49c","uuid":"2583a06e-6fdf-4a6d-9ee9-569b5fa3f3f0","timestamp":"2026-05-20T19:30:56.569Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519/projects/nlp_variance_gtheory/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T190053/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '原始framing完全成立。float32 confound修复后precision主效应坍缩至噪声水平，反而成为方法论贡献（展示engine配置对variance\n  attribution的系统性影响）。 Item dominance在所有benchmark上复现为最大单一方差源，4个模型一致。Separability在aggregate\n  level成立（direct interaction <0.5%）， 但item-conditional interactions提供nuanced story。D-study\n  budget表给出clear actionable guidance，headline数字\"item selection >50%\"直接可用。 AAAI投稿节奏正常，三条claim原封不动。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Full-scale precision study with confound fix\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: '4 models × 3 precisions (FP32/BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3\n    temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items, 全部使用vLLM V0 enforce_eager消除engine差异。总条件数\n    4×3×6×6×3×4=5184 per item, 总记录 5184×200=1,036,800。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 1036800\n    conditions_per_model: 1296\n    overall_accuracy: 0.668\n    accuracy_fp32: 0.666\n    accuracy_bf16: 0.671\n    accuracy_fp16: 0.669\n    accuracy_spread_across_precisions: 0.005\n    item_id: 0.584\n    residual: 0.168\n    prompt_template_x_item_id: 0.061\n    temperature_x_item_id: 0.058\n    seed_x_item_id: 0.029\n    precision_x_item_id: 0.018\n    ordering_x_item_id: 0.014\n    prompt_template: 0.009\n    temperature: 0.007\n    ordering: 0.003\n    precision: 0.003\n    seed: 0.001\n    models_with_item_id_rank1: 4\n    item_id_range_across_models:\n    - 0.52\n    - 0.62\n    qwen3_8b_item_id: 0.598\n    llama31_8b_item_id: 0.571\n    gemma2_9b_item_id: 0.62\n    mistral_7b_item_id: 0.547\n    precision_main_effect_before_fix_mvp: 0.0087\n    precision_main_effect_after_fix: 0.003\n    precision_x_item_id_before_fix_mvp: 0.0724\n    precision_x_item_id_after_fix: 0.018\n    fp32_bf16_accuracy_gap_before_fix: 0.085\n    fp32_bf16_accuracy_gap_after_fix: 0.005\n    g_current_practice_1p1s200i: 0.34\n    g_6p6s200i: 0.72\n    g_6p6s200i_3t4o: 0.78\n  result_rationale: 'MVP中precision主效应0.87%和precision×item交互7.24%主要来自float32使用不同vLLM\n    engine路径（非V0时触发不同kernel）， 导致FP32准确率系统性偏低5.7pp。统一V0 enforce_eager后，三种精度走同一compute\n    path， FP32/BF16/FP16准确率差收敛至0.5pp以内（纯numerical noise水平）。precision主效应从0.87%降至~0.3%，\n    precision×item从7.24%降至~1.8%。这些被释放的方差份额主要回流到residual和item_id， 使item_id维持在~58%（与MVP一致，因为item\n    difficulty本身是真实信号，不受engine confound影响）。 4个模型均以item_id为rank-1组分，因为MMLU的item difficulty分布（从trivial到expert-level）\n    在所有7-9B模型上产生类似的accuracy ceiling/floor效应。Gemma-2略高因其instruction-tuned特性 使其对easy\n    items更稳定（floor更高），Mistral略低因其在部分domain上accuracy更平坦。 200 items（分层采样）比MVP的50 items提供更稳定的方差估计，置信区间收窄约50%。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Variance Component Estimates — MMLU 200 items, 4 models pooled'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - '% Variance'\n    - SE\n    - 95% CI Lower\n    - 95% CI Upper\n    - MVP (50 items)\n    rows:\n    - - item_id\n      - 58.4\n      - 2.1\n      - 54.3\n      - 62.5\n      - 58.4\n    - - residual\n      - 16.8\n      - 0.9\n      - 15.0\n      - 18.6\n      - 17.6\n    - - prompt×item\n      - 6.1\n      - 0.7\n      - 4.7\n      - 7.5\n      - 5.7\n    - - temp×item\n      - 5.8\n      - 0.6\n      - 4.6\n      - 7.0\n      - 6.9\n    - - seed×item\n      - 2.9\n      - 0.4\n      - 2.1\n      - 3.7\n      - 2.7\n    - - precision×item\n      - 1.8\n      - 0.3\n      - 1.2\n      - 2.4\n      - 7.2*\n    - - ordering×item\n      - 1.4\n      - 0.3\n      - 0.8\n      - 2.0\n      - —\n    - - prompt\n      - 0.9\n      - 0.3\n      - 0.3\n      - 1.5\n      - —\n    - - temperature\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.2\n      - 0.3\n      - 1.1\n      - —\n    - - precision\n      - 0.3\n      - 0.1\n      - 0.1\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.87*\n    - - ordering\n      - 0.3\n      - 0.1\n      - 0.1\n      - 0.5\n      - —\n    - - seed\n      - 0.1\n      - 0.05\n      - 0.0\n      - 0.2\n      - —\n  - name: 'Table 2: Per-Model item_id Variance Share'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - item_id %\n    - Next Largest\n    - Next %\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-8B\n      - 59.8\n      - residual\n      - 16.2\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - 57.1\n      - residual\n      - 17.8\n    - - Gemma-2-9B-IT\n      - 62.0\n      - residual\n      - 14.9\n    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n      - 54.7\n      - residual\n      - 18.5\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1: Stacked-bar variance decomposition — MVP (confounded) vs exp-001 (fixed),\n    side-by-side。左栏显示precision和precision×item的膨胀，右栏显示修复后两者坍缩，item_id占比不变。'\n  - 'Fig 2: 4-panel per-model stacked bars，展示item_id始终为rank-1的cross-model consistency。'\n  - 'Fig 3: FP32 vs BF16 accuracy scatter (per-item)，MVP中slope偏离1.0，exp-001中回归到~1.0。'\n  analysis: '核心发现：engine confound修复后item dominance完全稳健，precision主效应从0.87%降至0.3%。 这同时验证了Claim\n    1（item dominance）和提供了方法论贡献（engine配置对variance attribution的影响）。 4个模型一致性消除了\"Qwen3特例\"的concern。200\n    items分层采样提供了足够的statistical power。 Ordering facet新增后占比很小（~1.7% total含interaction），说明item\n    presentation order不是主要concern。\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-benchmark replication\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: '4 models × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures\n    × 4 orderings × 200 items, 分别在GSM8K、ARC-Challenge、HellaSwag上运行。每benchmark总记录 4×2×6×6×2×4×200=230,400。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    gsm8k_overall_accuracy: 0.583\n    gsm8k_item_id: 0.487\n    gsm8k_residual: 0.214\n    gsm8k_temperature_x_item_id: 0.089\n    gsm8k_prompt_x_item_id: 0.072\n    gsm8k_seed_x_item_id: 0.041\n    gsm8k_precision_x_item_id: 0.012\n    gsm8k_ordering_x_item_id: 0.018\n    gsm8k_temperature: 0.024\n    gsm8k_prompt: 0.015\n    gsm8k_precision: 0.002\n    gsm8k_g_current_practice: 0.29\n    arc_overall_accuracy: 0.597\n    arc_item_id: 0.551\n    arc_residual: 0.182\n    arc_prompt_x_item_id: 0.068\n    arc_temperature_x_item_id: 0.054\n    arc_seed_x_item_id: 0.031\n    arc_precision_x_item_id: 0.014\n    arc_ordering_x_item_id: 0.016\n    arc_prompt: 0.011\n    arc_temperature: 0.008\n    arc_precision: 0.002\n    arc_g_current_practice: 0.32\n    hellaswag_overall_accuracy: 0.712\n    hellaswag_item_id: 0.527\n    hellaswag_residual: 0.195\n    hellaswag_prompt_x_item_id: 0.058\n    hellaswag_temperature_x_item_id: 0.062\n    hellaswag_seed_x_item_id: 0.033\n    hellaswag_precision_x_item_id: 0.011\n    hellaswag_ordering_x_item_id: 0.019\n    hellaswag_prompt: 0.008\n    hellaswag_temperature: 0.006\n    hellaswag_precision: 0.001\n    hellaswag_g_current_practice: 0.36\n    benchmarks_with_item_id_rank1: 4\n    item_id_range_across_benchmarks:\n    - 0.487\n    - 0.584\n    cross_benchmark_replication_rate: 1.0\n    models_showing_consistent_pattern: 4\n  result_rationale: 'GSM8K的item_id占比略低于MMLU（48.7% vs 58.4%），因为数学推理任务引入更多chain-of-thought随机性，\n    使residual和temperature×item交互膨胀。GSM8K中温度效应更大（temperature×item 8.9%）， 因为CoT生成路径对sampling\n    temperature更敏感——同一道数学题在不同温度下可能走完全不同的推理链。 但item_id仍然是rank-1组分，因为GSM8K的difficulty\n    gradient极陡（从单步算术到多步word problem）， 这种item-level variance在所有条件下都主导。ARC-Challenge的item_id（55.1%）接近MMLU，\n    因为科学推理题的difficulty分布类似（从factual recall到multi-hop inference）。 HellaSwag的item_id（52.7%）也稳健，因为commonsense\n    completion的item variance主要来自 distractor quality差异——有些items的wrong answers显而易见，有些几乎无法区分。\n    所有benchmark上precision主效应均<0.3%，确认engine confound fix的泛化性。 4/4 benchmark的item_id\n    rank-1复现率为100%，支撑\"cross-benchmark replication rate = 1.0\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: Cross-Benchmark Variance Decomposition Summary'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - item_id %\n    - Residual %\n    - Item-Conditional Total %\n    - Precision Main %\n    - G (current)\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 58.4\n      - 16.8\n      - 16.1\n      - 0.3\n      - 0.34\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 48.7\n      - 21.4\n      - 23.2\n      - 0.2\n      - 0.29\n    - - ARC-Challenge\n      - 55.1\n      - 18.2\n      - 18.3\n      - 0.2\n      - 0.32\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 52.7\n      - 19.5\n      - 18.3\n      - 0.1\n      - 0.36\n  - name: 'Table 4: GSM8K Per-Model Breakdown'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - item_id %\n    - temp×item %\n    - prompt×item %\n    - residual %\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-8B\n      - 51.2\n      - 8.1\n      - 6.8\n      - 19.8\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - 47.3\n      - 9.4\n      - 7.6\n      - 22.1\n    - - Gemma-2-9B-IT\n      - 50.8\n      - 8.5\n      - 6.9\n      - 20.3\n    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n      - 43.4\n      - 10.5\n      - 8.3\n      - 23.5\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 4: 4-benchmark stacked-bar variance decomposition并排对比。item_id始终为最大色块，但GSM8K的residual和temperature×item色块明显更大。'\n  - 'Fig 5: Heatmap — benchmark × model × component，展示pattern consistency。色块深浅表示variance\n    share，item_id行始终最深。'\n  analysis: 'Item dominance在4个benchmark上全部复现（range 48.7%-58.4%），但幅度因task type有系统性差异：\n    generation-heavy tasks（GSM8K）因CoT随机性使residual膨胀，压缩item_id相对占比； classification-like\n    tasks（MMLU, ARC）的item_id更高。这个gradient本身是有趣的发现， 可在Discussion中展开。关键是即使在\"worst case\"的GSM8K上，item_id仍是rank-1（48.7%\n    > residual 21.4%）， headline claim成立。\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-hardware G-study\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: '4 models × 2 GPU types (RTX PRO 6000 + second GPU) × 2 precisions\n    (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。总记录\n    4×2×2×6×6×3×4×200=691,200。 核心目标：量化hardware主效应和hardware×methodology交互。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 691200\n    hardware_main_effect: 0.006\n    hardware_x_precision: 0.002\n    hardware_x_prompt: 0.001\n    hardware_x_temperature: 0.001\n    hardware_x_seed: 0.0005\n    hardware_x_ordering: 0.0003\n    hardware_x_item_id: 0.019\n    precision_x_prompt: 0.0008\n    precision_x_temperature: 0.0006\n    precision_x_seed: 0.0003\n    precision_x_ordering: 0.0002\n    direct_infra_method_interaction_total: 0.005\n    item_conditional_interactions_total: 0.142\n    item_id: 0.561\n    residual: 0.152\n    prompt_x_item: 0.059\n    temperature_x_item: 0.055\n    seed_x_item: 0.028\n    precision_x_item: 0.017\n    ordering_x_item: 0.013\n    hardware_x_item: 0.019\n    separability_ratio: 0.035\n    gpu1_gpu2_accuracy_correlation: 0.9987\n    max_accuracy_difference_any_condition: 0.018\n    mean_accuracy_difference: 0.004\n    g_current_practice: 0.33\n    g_full_design: 0.81\n  result_rationale: 'Hardware主效应0.6%反映两块GPU的微架构差异（不同SM count、memory bandwidth、kernel\n    scheduling）， 但这些差异是系统性的（固定偏移），不是随机的，所以主效应很小。hardware×item交互1.9%比hardware主效应大，\n    因为特定items（如需要长sequence generation的items）在不同GPU上因kernel tiling差异产生不同的numerical\n    path， 但这只影响边界case items。所有direct infra×method交互加总仅0.5%，因为infrastructure层（hardware\n    type, precision） 和methodology层（prompt, seed, temperature, ordering）作用于不同的computation\n    stages： precision/hardware影响numerical computation，prompt/seed/temperature影响token\n    sampling， 两者的交叉点（sampling受precision影响的程度）在logit空间中被softmax压缩到negligible水平。 Item-conditional\n    interactions总和14.2%远大于direct interactions 0.5%，验证了Claim 2的nuanced story： separability在aggregate成立，但两层都通过item\n    difficulty调节其效应。 GPU间accuracy correlation 0.9987说明hardware几乎不改变model ranking，只在individual\n    item level引入微小噪声。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5: Separability Test — Direct vs Item-Conditional Interactions'\n    columns:\n    - Interaction Type\n    - Components\n    - Total % Variance\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Direct Infra×Method\n      - hw×prompt, hw×temp, hw×seed, hw×ord, prec×prompt, prec×temp, prec×seed, prec×ord\n      - 0.5\n      - Negligible — separability holds at aggregate\n    - - Infra×Item\n      - hw×item, prec×item\n      - 3.6\n      - Small but non-zero — hardware/precision effects are item-conditional\n    - - Method×Item\n      - prompt×item, temp×item, seed×item, ord×item\n      - 15.5\n      - Substantial — methodology effects are strongly item-conditional\n    - - Item Main\n      - item_id\n      - 56.1\n      - Dominant — item selection is the primary variance source\n  - name: 'Table 6: Hardware Agreement Matrix (per-model mean accuracy)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - GPU1\n    - GPU2\n    - Difference\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-8B\n      - 0.671\n      - 0.668\n      - 0.003\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - 0.654\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.004\n    - - Gemma-2-9B-IT\n      - 0.689\n      - 0.684\n      - 0.005\n    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n      - 0.638\n      - 0.634\n      - 0.004\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 6: Separability diagram — 两层圆（infra layer, method layer）通过item difficulty连接，直接交互箭头用虚线（<0.5%），item-conditional箭头用实线。'\n  - 'Fig 7: GPU1 vs GPU2 per-item accuracy scatter，近乎perfect diagonal，少数outlier items标注。'\n  analysis: 'Separability成立：direct infra×method交互总和0.5%，远低于1%阈值。但不是trivial null result——\n    item-conditional interactions（14.2%）提供了nuanced interpretation：infrastructure和methodology\n    不是完全独立的，而是通过item difficulty间接耦合。这比simple \"separable/not separable\"更有价值， 因为它解释了为什么isolated-factor\n    studies的结论在某些items上不泛化。 这同时支撑了Claim 2的两半：\"empirical license for isolated-factor\n    studies\"（direct <0.5%） 和 \"conclusions are conditional on item selection\"（item-conditional\n    14.2%）。\n\n    '\n- name: D-study reproducibility budget projections\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: '基于exp-001/002/003的合并variance component estimates，计算不同facet allocation下的G系数。\n    生成practitioner-facing budget tables和projection curves。纯计算，无GPU开销。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    g_1prompt_1seed_200items_mmlu: 0.34\n    g_1prompt_1seed_200items_gsm8k: 0.29\n    g_1prompt_1seed_200items_arc: 0.32\n    g_1prompt_1seed_200items_hellaswag: 0.36\n    g_1prompt_1seed_600items_mmlu: 0.71\n    g_1prompt_1seed_1000items_mmlu: 0.82\n    g_1prompt_1seed_2000items_mmlu: 0.9\n    g_3prompt_1seed_200items_mmlu: 0.42\n    g_6prompt_1seed_200items_mmlu: 0.49\n    g_12prompt_1seed_200items_mmlu: 0.54\n    g_1prompt_3seed_200items_mmlu: 0.36\n    g_1prompt_6seed_200items_mmlu: 0.37\n    optimal_g90_items: 600\n    optimal_g90_prompts: 3\n    optimal_g90_seeds: 2\n    optimal_g90_total_conditions: 6\n    optimal_g90_total_evaluations: 3600\n    optimal_g95_items: 1200\n    optimal_g95_prompts: 4\n    optimal_g95_seeds: 3\n    optimal_g95_total_conditions: 12\n    optimal_g95_total_evaluations: 14400\n    marginal_g_per_100_items: 0.038\n    marginal_g_per_prompt: 0.025\n    marginal_g_per_seed: 0.005\n    items_vs_prompts_effectiveness_ratio: 10.2\n    items_vs_seeds_effectiveness_ratio: 51.0\n    gsm8k_optimal_g90_items: 800\n    gsm8k_optimal_g90_prompts: 3\n    gsm8k_optimal_g90_seeds: 2\n    arc_optimal_g90_items: 650\n    hellaswag_optimal_g90_items: 550\n  result_rationale: 'G系数由universe score variance与observed score variance的比值决定。因为item_id占总方差>50%，\n    增加item采样直接压缩最大的variance component，G提升最快。具体地，G ≈ σ²(τ) / [σ²(τ) + σ²(δ)/n_facets]，\n    当item_id是σ²(δ)的主要贡献者时，增加n_items的marginal return远超增加n_prompts或n_seeds。 数值上，从200到600\n    items（3×）使G从0.34升至0.71，而从1到3 prompts（3×）仅从0.34升至0.42。 这是因为prompt variance（含prompt×item）共计~7%，而item\n    variance 58%。 Seed几乎无效（G从0.34到0.37 at 6 seeds），因为seed的总方差贡献<3%（主要通过seed×item）。\n    G≥0.90需要~600 items + 3 prompts + 2 seeds = 3,600 evaluations。 当前标准practice（1 prompt,\n    1 seed, 200 items）的G < 0.40意味着evaluation结果的reliability 低于社会科学中\"不可接受\"的阈值（通常G≥0.80）。\n    GSM8K需要更多items（800 vs 600）达到G≥0.90，因为其residual更大（CoT随机性）， 需要更多items来平均掉item-level\n    noise。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 7: Reproducibility Budget — MMLU (Items × Prompts × Seeds → G coefficient)'\n    columns:\n    - Items\n    - Prompts\n    - Seeds\n    - Total Evals\n    - G coeff\n    - Δ vs Current\n    rows:\n    - - 200\n      - 1\n      - 1\n      - 200\n      - 0.34\n      - baseline\n    - - 200\n      - 3\n      - 1\n      - 600\n      - 0.42\n      - '+0.08'\n    - - 200\n      - 6\n      - 1\n      - 1200\n      - 0.49\n      - '+0.15'\n    - - 200\n      - 6\n      - 6\n      - 7200\n      - 0.54\n      - '+0.20'\n    - - 600\n      - 1\n      - 1\n      - 600\n      - 0.71\n      - '+0.37'\n    - - 600\n      - 3\n      - 1\n      - 1800\n      - 0.82\n      - '+0.48'\n    - - 600\n      - 3\n      - 2\n      - 3600\n      - 0.9\n      - '+0.56'\n    - - 1000\n      - 3\n      - 2\n      - 6000\n      - 0.93\n      - '+0.59'\n    - - 1200\n      - 4\n      - 3\n      - 14400\n      - 0.95\n      - '+0.61'\n    - - 2000\n      - 4\n      - 3\n      - 24000\n      - 0.97\n      - '+0.63'\n  - name: 'Table 8: Cross-Benchmark Minimum Budget for G≥0.90'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - Items\n    - Prompts\n    - Seeds\n    - Total Evals\n    - Cost Factor vs Current\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 600\n      - 3\n      - 2\n      - 3600\n      - 18×\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 800\n      - 3\n      - 2\n      - 4800\n      - 24×\n    - - ARC-Challenge\n      - 650\n      - 3\n      - 2\n      - 3900\n      - 19.5×\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 550\n      - 3\n      - 2\n      - 3300\n      - 16.5×\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 8: D-study projection curves — G coefficient vs total evaluations，三条线分别对应\n    scale items only / scale prompts only / scale seeds only。Items线陡峭上升，prompts线平缓，seeds线几乎flat。'\n  - 'Fig 9: Iso-G contour plot（items × prompts平面，G值等高线），展示最优allocation路径沿items轴延伸。'\n  - 'Fig 10: 4-benchmark overlay projection curves，展示GSM8K需要更多evaluations但pattern一致。'\n  analysis: 'Claim 3的核心表格。Headline数字：\"tripling items is 10× more effective than tripling\n    prompts\" 直接来自marginal effectiveness ratio 10.2:1。当前practice G<0.40的发现具有强policy\n    implication—— 意味着现有leaderboard结果的measurement reliability低于社会科学中最低标准。 600 items\n    + 3 prompts + 2 seeds的\"recommended minimum\"在计算成本上仅为full factorial的一小部分， 是actionable的建议。跨benchmark\n    budget差异（550-800 items for G≥0.90）提供task-specific guidance。\n\n    '\n- name: 14B model extension\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: 'Qwen3-14B和DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts\n    × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。每模型 2×6×6×3×4×200=172,800记录。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen3_14b_accuracy: 0.728\n    deepseek_r1_14b_accuracy: 0.714\n    qwen3_14b_item_id: 0.574\n    deepseek_r1_14b_item_id: 0.538\n    qwen3_14b_residual: 0.162\n    deepseek_r1_14b_residual: 0.198\n    deepseek_r1_14b_temperature_x_item: 0.082\n    scale_effect_on_item_id: within 8B model range\n    item_id_rank1_both_models: true\n    variance_pattern_consistent_with_8b: true\n    precision_main_effect_14b: 0.002\n  result_rationale: '14B模型的overall accuracy更高，但item difficulty的variance structure不会因scale改变——\n    easy items仍然easy，hard items仍然hard。Item_id占比略低于8B平均值（~55-57% vs ~58%）， 因为14B模型在medium-difficulty\n    items上表现更一致（ceiling effect压缩了item variance的上端）， 但差异不大。DeepSeek-R1-Distill的reasoning-distilled特性使其在CoT-heavy\n    items上产生更多 temperature×item交互（类似GSM8K的pattern），residual也略高，因为distillation引入的implicit\n    CoT 增加了generation-level stochasticity。关键是item_id在两个14B模型上仍为rank-1， 确认pattern不随model\n    scale改变。precision主效应在14B上同样negligible（0.2%）， 因为confound fix的原理（统一engine path）与model\n    size无关。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 9: 14B vs 8B Variance Pattern Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - 8B Mean\n    - 8B Range\n    - Qwen3-14B\n    - DS-R1-14B\n    rows:\n    - - item_id\n      - 58.4\n      - 54.7–62.0\n      - 57.4\n      - 53.8\n    - - residual\n      - 16.8\n      - 14.9–18.5\n      - 16.2\n      - 19.8\n    - - temp×item\n      - 5.8\n      - 4.6–7.0\n      - 5.3\n      - 8.2\n    - - prompt×item\n      - 6.1\n      - 4.7–7.5\n      - 5.8\n      - 5.4\n    - - precision\n      - 0.3\n      - 0.1–0.5\n      - 0.2\n      - 0.2\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 11: 6-model panel（4×8B + 2×14B）stacked bars，展示scale不改变variance hierarchy。'\n  analysis: 'Scale invariance确认：item dominance不是小模型artifacts。DeepSeek-R1-Distill的slightly不同的profile\n    （更高residual, 更高temp×item）提供了architecture effect的初步evidence， 但不改变core claim。这是P1实验，为paper增加robustness但非必需。\n\n    '\n- name: Fine-tuning G-study\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: 'RoBERTa-large在SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA上fine-tuning。6 seeds × 3 learning\n    rates × 4 data shuffles × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task × 4 tasks = 1,728\n    total。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    sst2_accuracy_mean: 0.948\n    sst2_item_id: 0.412\n    sst2_seed: 0.087\n    sst2_learning_rate: 0.063\n    sst2_data_shuffle: 0.042\n    sst2_seed_x_item: 0.098\n    sst2_lr_x_item: 0.074\n    sst2_residual: 0.131\n    sst2_gpu: 0.003\n    sst2_precision: 0.002\n    mnli_accuracy_mean: 0.876\n    mnli_item_id: 0.445\n    mnli_seed: 0.072\n    mnli_learning_rate: 0.081\n    mnli_data_shuffle: 0.038\n    mnli_seed_x_item: 0.091\n    mnli_residual: 0.142\n    rte_accuracy_mean: 0.743\n    rte_item_id: 0.368\n    rte_seed: 0.124\n    rte_learning_rate: 0.098\n    rte_data_shuffle: 0.067\n    rte_seed_x_item: 0.112\n    rte_residual: 0.158\n    copa_accuracy_mean: 0.682\n    copa_item_id: 0.382\n    copa_seed: 0.118\n    copa_learning_rate: 0.091\n    copa_residual: 0.167\n    item_id_rank1_all_tasks: true\n    seed_more_important_than_inference: true\n    infra_effects_negligible: true\n    fine_tuning_g_current_practice: 0.28\n  result_rationale: 'Fine-tuning与inference的关键区别：training seed和learning rate成为substantial\n    variance sources （combined 10-22%），因为它们影响optimization trajectory，不仅仅是sampling\n    randomness。 但item_id仍然是rank-1（37-45%），因为NLU tasks的item difficulty gradient—— 从\"I\n    love this movie\"(trivially positive)到需要subtle pragmatic inference的examples—— 在所有training\n    configurations下都产生consistent accuracy variation。 RTE的item_id最低（36.8%），因为小数据集（2.5K\n    training examples）使fine-tuning对seed更敏感， seed主效应膨胀到12.4%。这为paper提供了\"inference vs\n    fine-tuning\"的对比dimension： 两者都是item-dominant，但fine-tuning中training hyperparameters（seed,\n    LR）取代了 inference中的generation parameters（temperature, prompt）成为第二梯队的variance sources。\n    GPU和precision主效应在fine-tuning中同样negligible（<0.5%），因为RoBERTa-large 对numerical precision不敏感（unlike\n    large generative models的autoregressive error accumulation）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 10: Fine-tuning vs Inference Variance Hierarchy'\n    columns:\n    - Rank\n    - Inference (MMLU)\n    - Fine-tuning (SST-2)\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - item_id (58.4%)\n      - item_id (41.2%)\n    - - 2\n      - residual (16.8%)\n      - residual (13.1%)\n    - - 3\n      - prompt×item (6.1%)\n      - seed×item (9.8%)\n    - - 4\n      - temp×item (5.8%)\n      - seed (8.7%)\n    - - 5\n      - seed×item (2.9%)\n      - lr×item (7.4%)\n    - - 6\n      - precision×item (1.8%)\n      - lr (6.3%)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 12: Inference vs Fine-tuning stacked bars并排，展示item_id在两个paradigm中均为rank-1但fine-tuning中seed/LR更prominent。'\n  - 'Fig 13: 4-task fine-tuning panel，展示dataset size对variance structure的调节效应（RTE seed最大）。'\n  analysis: 'Fine-tuning G-study将paper从\"inference evaluation reproducibility\"扩展到\"ML\n    reproducibility broadly\"。 核心takeaway：item dominance是跨paradigm的（inference和fine-tuning），但second-tier\n    factors不同。 这是P1实验，为paper增加generality但AAAI投稿时可作为supplementary。\n\n    '\n- name: LayerCast precision study\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: '在MMLU上测试LayerCast（FP16 storage + FP32 compute）作为额外precision condition。\n    4 models × 1 precision mode × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings\n    × 200 items = 172,800记录。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    layercast_accuracy_mean: 0.67\n    layercast_vs_fp32_accuracy_diff: 0.004\n    layercast_vs_bf16_accuracy_diff: -0.001\n    layercast_item_agreement_with_fp32: 0.9991\n    layercast_item_agreement_with_bf16: 0.9994\n    layercast_added_variance_to_precision: 0.0004\n    layercast_throughput_vs_fp32: 1.38\n    layercast_throughput_vs_bf16: 0.91\n    layercast_precision_x_item_contribution: 0.009\n  result_rationale: 'LayerCast在存储时用FP16减少memory footprint，在compute时cast to FP32， 因此其numerical\n    behavior几乎等同于纯FP32（computation path一致）， accuracy差异仅来自storage时的precision loss（FP16\n    mantissa 10 bits vs FP32 23 bits）， 这对大部分weights来说negligible（在训练时weights就是从FP16/BF16来的）。\n    与BF16的差异更小（0.1pp），因为BF16的dynamic range与FP32一致（8-bit exponent）， 而FP16的range更窄但mantissa更宽，两者accuracy接近。\n    LayerCast对precision variance几乎没有增量贡献（0.04%），因为它本质上是FP32 compute的cheaper variant。\n    Throughput方面，LayerCast比FP32快38%（memory bandwidth节省），比BF16慢9%（需要cast操作）。 这个实验为paper提供了一个\"practical\n    mitigation\"故事：如果practitioner担心precision影响， LayerCast以minimal overhead提供FP32-level\n    behavior。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 11: Precision Mode Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - Mode\n    - Accuracy\n    - item Agreement w/ FP32\n    - Throughput (tokens/s)\n    - VRAM (GB)\n    rows:\n    - - FP32\n      - 0.666\n      - 1.0\n      - 1820\n      - 31.2\n    - - BF16\n      - 0.671\n      - 0.9985\n      - 2760\n      - 15.8\n    - - FP16\n      - 0.669\n      - 0.9982\n      - 2810\n      - 15.6\n    - - LayerCast\n      - 0.67\n      - 0.9991\n      - 2510\n      - 16.1\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 14: 4-precision mode accuracy distribution violin plots，展示LayerCast与FP32几乎identical\n    spread。'\n  analysis: 'P2实验。LayerCast结果进一步support precision不是major concern（在engine confound\n    fix后）。 可作为paper中\"practical recommendation\"段落的一条：对于追求最高reproducibility的场景， LayerCast提供了memory-efficient的FP32-equivalent选项。\n\n    '\n- name: MATH benchmark extension\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: '4 models × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures\n    × 4 orderings × 200 MATH items。 总记录 4×2×6×6×2×4×200=230,400。测试reasoning-heavy\n    task的variance structure。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    math_overall_accuracy: 0.342\n    math_item_id: 0.421\n    math_residual: 0.248\n    math_temperature_x_item: 0.104\n    math_prompt_x_item: 0.068\n    math_seed_x_item: 0.052\n    math_temperature: 0.038\n    math_prompt: 0.021\n    math_precision: 0.002\n    math_precision_x_item: 0.008\n    math_ordering_x_item: 0.015\n    math_g_current_practice: 0.24\n    math_item_id_rank1: true\n    math_optimal_g90_items: 1100\n    math_optimal_g90_prompts: 4\n    math_optimal_g90_seeds: 3\n  result_rationale: 'MATH是所有benchmark中最challenging的（accuracy ~34%），其item difficulty分布极端——\n    从Level 1（algebra basics）到Level 5（competition math），跨越巨大的difficulty range。 Item_id仍为rank-1（42.1%）但低于MMLU，因为：(1)\n    lower overall accuracy增加了random guessing的比例， 膨胀residual到24.8%；(2) MATH的CoT generation比GSM8K更长更复杂（多步proof-like\n    reasoning）， 使temperature×item interaction达到10.4%——在高temperature下，长推理链的任何一步都可能diverge，\n    且这种sensitivity是item-specific的（Level 5 problems的长推理链比Level 1的短计算更sensitive）。 Temperature主效应也最高（3.8%），因为MATH的generation\n    length使sampling temperature的cumulative effect更显著。 G current practice仅0.24——所有benchmark中最低——意味着MATH\n    evaluation的reproducibility最差。 达到G≥0.90需要1100 items + 4 prompts + 3 seeds，是MMLU所需的~3倍evaluation\n    budget。 这个发现有strong policy implication：reasoning benchmark的evaluation标准需要比classification\n    benchmark更严格。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 12: Full Cross-Benchmark Variance Summary (5 benchmarks)'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - Accuracy\n    - item_id %\n    - Residual %\n    - Temp×Item %\n    - G (current)\n    - Items for G≥0.90\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 0.668\n      - 58.4\n      - 16.8\n      - 5.8\n      - 0.34\n      - 600\n    - - ARC-Challenge\n      - 0.597\n      - 55.1\n      - 18.2\n      - 5.4\n      - 0.32\n      - 650\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 0.712\n      - 52.7\n      - 19.5\n      - 6.2\n      - 0.36\n      - 550\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 0.583\n      - 48.7\n      - 21.4\n      - 8.9\n      - 0.29\n      - 800\n    - - MATH\n      - 0.342\n      - 42.1\n      - 24.8\n      - 10.4\n      - 0.24\n      - 1100\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 15: 5-benchmark stacked bars排序by task difficulty，展示清晰的gradient：task越难→item_id越低、residual和temp×item越高。'\n  - 'Fig 16: D-study projection curves for 5 benchmarks overlay，MATH曲线最右（需最多evaluations达G≥0.90）。'\n  analysis: MATH提供了variance structure的\"stress test\"。Item_id在最extreme条件下仍为rank-1（42.1%），\n    但task difficulty明显调节了variance decomposition的profile。5个benchmark展现了清晰的gradient：\n    task difficulty ↑ → item_id share ↓, residual ↑, temperature×item ↑, G current\n    practice ↓。 这个gradient本身是publishable finding：它量化了为什么reasoning benchmark的evaluation更不稳定，\n    并给出了task-specific的reproducibility budget。\n","numLines":884,"startLine":1,"totalLines":884}}}
